  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to first occupation the approved cycle parking facilities shall be provided and\r\npermanently maintained thereafter.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure sustainable forms of transport are catered for.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly\r\nin accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent\r\napproval of details.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full\r\naccordance with the plans hereby approved.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the details shown on the plans hereby approved the following\r\nshall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to\r\nfirst occupation of the approved development. The development shall be carried out\r\nin full accordance with the approved details.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a. Confirmation that the installed Air Source Heat Pump systems are on the\r\nGovernments Energy Technology list;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;b. Statement from supplier to confirm that the product meets the relevant eligibility\r\ncriteria at the time of purchase.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In order to promote sustainable development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The approved Contaminated Land Remediation Scheme shall be carried out and\r\nprior to first occupation of the development hereby approved a Verification Report\r\nshall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To protect the future occupiers of the development and adjoining occupiers\r\nfrom contamination.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;At least one of the residential units in the approved development shall be\r\nadaptable for wheelchair users in compliance with Part M of the Building Regulations\r\n(or any future similar Building Regulations).\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure adequate standards of residential accessibility.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall be carried out in accordance with the\r\nfollowing details that have already been approved by the Local Planning Authority or\r\nin accordance with any alternative details that may be approved in writing by the\r\nLocal Planning Authority (note the condition numbers relate to the numbers given on\r\nthe original planning permission ref: 2016/3333):\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. SuDs details with the additional note that a blue roof is no longer a requirement;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5. Delivery and Servicing Plan;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;6. Demolition and Construction Management Plan;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;9. Hard &amp;amp; Soft Landscaping;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;10. Recycling Management Strategy;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;11. Air Quality Assessment;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;13. Scheme of Archaeological Investigation;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;14. Facing Materials;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;15. Contaminated Land Risk Assessment;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;16. Contaminated Land Remediation Scheme;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;19. Ecology &amp;amp; Biodiversity Enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that the details of the development and the way in which it is\r\ncarried out are satisfactory.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
